# Keep checkouts byte-identical across platforms.
#
# The Skill entry point (skills/yichen-jianying-edit/scripts/headless_draft.py)
# and bridge/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json verify components by raw sha256. A Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every LF to CRLF, which changes
# those hashes and makes `doctor` refuse to run for a reason that has nothing to
# do with the installation. Forcing LF here keeps the pins valid everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.mp4 binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
